    "body": "The summaries reviewed before renewal review ends with one change, one owner, and a date to re-measure the same population. The summaries reviewed before renewal review reports a null result as clearly as a positive one. The summaries reviewed before renewal review uses a queue export drawn before the meeting rather than memorable cases. The summaries reviewed before renewal review ends with one testable change, one owner, and a re-measure date. Review pass 8.1: the account team files the summaries reviewed before renewal evidence.\n\nThe summaries reviewed before renewal evidence stays in the contract file, while the analysis note keeps only the reference and the access path. A summaries reviewed before renewal review that finds no gap still records the sample, the window, and the exclusions. A summaries reviewed before renewal pattern is described before it is called a trend, and outliers are explained at case level. Sensitive summaries reviewed before renewal evidence stays in the approved repository, and the analysis note keeps only the access path. Review pass 8.2: the account team files the summaries reviewed before renewal evidence."
